{"book":"zhongyong","id":"sishu.zhongyong.33","index":33,"passages":[{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.33.01","number":1,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"modern":"诗","pinyin":"shī","traditional":"詩","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yuē","traditional":"曰","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"：“"},{"pinyin":"yī","traditional":"衣","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"锦","pinyin":"jǐn","traditional":"錦","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shàng","traditional":"尚","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"䌹","pinyin":"jiōng","traditional":"絅","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"”，"},{"modern":"恶","pinyin":"è","traditional":"惡","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wén","traditional":"文","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"着","pinyin":"zhù","traditional":"著","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yě","traditional":"也","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"gù","traditional":"故","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jūn","traditional":"君","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dào","traditional":"道","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"àn","traditional":"暗","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rán","traditional":"然","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rì","traditional":"日","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhāng","traditional":"章","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"；"},{"pinyin":"xiǎo","traditional":"小","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rén","traditional":"人","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dào","traditional":"道","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"de","traditional":"的","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rán","traditional":"然","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rì","traditional":"日","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wáng","traditional":"亡","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"jūn","traditional":"君","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dào","traditional":"道","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"dàn","traditional":"淡","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"厌","pinyin":"yàn","traditional":"厭","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"modern":"简","pinyin":"jiǎn","traditional":"簡","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wén","traditional":"文","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"modern":"温","pinyin":"wēn","traditional":"溫","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"lǐ","traditional":"理","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"知","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"远","pinyin":"yuǎn","traditional":"遠","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jìn","traditional":"近","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"知","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"风","pinyin":"fēng","traditional":"風","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zì","traditional":"自","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"知","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wēi","traditional":"微","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"显","pinyin":"xiǎn","traditional":"顯","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"kě","traditional":"可","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"与","pinyin":"yǔ","traditional":"與","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rù","traditional":"入","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dé","traditional":"德","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"矣","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Di dalam Kitab Sanjak tertulis, \"Mantel sederhana untuk penutup baju bersulam.\" (I.5.3.1) Inilah menunjukkan kebencian akan kemewahan yang menyolok. Maka Jalan Suci seorang Junzi - Kuncu itu mula-mula nampak kabur, namun bertambah hari bertambah cemerlang; sedang perbuatan seorang rendah budi itu mula-mula nampak gemilang, namun bertambah hari bertambah suram dan akhirnya musna. Jalan Suci seorang Junzi - Kuncu itu tawar tetapi tidak menjemukan, sederhana tetapi tertib, ramah tamah tetapi menurut peraturan, mengetahui hal yang jauh berdasarkan hal yang dekat, mengetahui dari mana angin (pengaruh) berasal, mengetahui kenyataan dan perkara yang lembut dan rahasia. Sungguh ia telah masuk di dalam Kebajikan."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.33.02","number":2,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"modern":"诗","pinyin":"shī","traditional":"詩","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yún","traditional":"云","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"：“"},{"modern":"潜","pinyin":"qián","traditional":"潛","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"虽","pinyin":"suī","traditional":"雖","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"fú","traditional":"伏","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"矣","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"yì","traditional":"亦","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"kǒng","traditional":"孔","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhāo","traditional":"昭","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。”"},{"pinyin":"gù","traditional":"故","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jūn","traditional":"君","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"内","pinyin":"nèi","traditional":"內","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shěng","traditional":"省","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jiù","traditional":"疚","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"无","pinyin":"wú","traditional":"無","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"恶","pinyin":"è","traditional":"惡","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"于","pinyin":"yú","traditional":"於","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhì","traditional":"志","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"jūn","traditional":"君","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"suǒ","traditional":"所","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"kě","traditional":"可","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jí","traditional":"及","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhě","traditional":"者","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wéi","traditional":"唯","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rén","traditional":"人","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"suǒ","traditional":"所","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"见","pinyin":"jiàn","traditional":"見","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"hū","traditional":"乎","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Di dalam Kitab Sanjak tertulis, \"Biar tenggelam sedalam-dalamnya, tetap tegas terlihat.\" (II. 4.8.11). Maka seorang Junzi - Kuncu senantiasa memeriksa diri, sehingga tiada bercacat. Dengan demikian baharulah ia tidak merasa kecewa. Adapun sebabnya seorang Junzi - Kuncu itu tidak dapat ditandingi ialah: ia mempunyai sifat-sifat khusus yang tidak dapat dilihat orang lain."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.33.03","number":3,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"modern":"诗","pinyin":"shī","traditional":"詩","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yún","traditional":"云","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"：“"},{"pinyin":"xiāng","traditional":"相","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zài","traditional":"在","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"尔","pinyin":"ěr","traditional":"爾","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shì","traditional":"室","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"shàng","traditional":"尚","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"kuì","traditional":"愧","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"于","pinyin":"yú","traditional":"於","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wū","traditional":"屋","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"lòu","traditional":"漏","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。”"},{"pinyin":"gù","traditional":"故","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jūn","traditional":"君","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"动","pinyin":"dòng","traditional":"動","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jìng","traditional":"敬","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yán","traditional":"言","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xìn","traditional":"信","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Di dalam Kitab Sanjak tertulis, \"Periksalah rumahmu, jagalah jangan ada yang memalukan sekalipun di sudut-sudut rumah.\" (III. 3.2.7) Maka, seorang Junzi - Kuncu pada saat tidak berbuat sesuatu, tetap bersikap hormat dan pada saat tidak berbicara, tetap memegang sikap dapat dipercaya."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.33.04","number":4,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"modern":"诗","pinyin":"shī","traditional":"詩","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yuē","traditional":"曰","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"：“"},{"pinyin":"zòu","traditional":"奏","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jiǎ","traditional":"假","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"无","pinyin":"wú","traditional":"無","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yán","traditional":"言","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"时","pinyin":"shí","traditional":"時","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"mí","traditional":"靡","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǒu","traditional":"有","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"争","pinyin":"zhēng","traditional":"爭","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。”"},{"pinyin":"shì","traditional":"是","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"gù","traditional":"故","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jūn","traditional":"君","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"赏","pinyin":"shǎng","traditional":"賞","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"mín","traditional":"民","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"劝","pinyin":"quàn","traditional":"勸","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"nù","traditional":"怒","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"mín","traditional":"民","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wēi","traditional":"威","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"于","pinyin":"yú","traditional":"於","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"𫓧","pinyin":"fū","traditional":"鈇","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"钺","pinyin":"yuè","traditional":"鉞","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Di dalam Kitab Sanjak tertulis, \"Di dalam bersujud hendaklah tulus tanpa bercakap, sepanjang saat tidak lalai.\" (IV. 3.2.2). Maka seorang Junzi - Kuncu itu dengan tanpa menjanjikan hadiah dapat membawa rakyat hidup baik, tanpa marah dapat menjadikan rakyat menaruh hormat melebihi ancaman hukuman dengan golok dan kapak."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.33.05","number":5,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"modern":"诗","pinyin":"shī","traditional":"詩","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yuē","traditional":"曰","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"：“"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"显","pinyin":"xiǎn","traditional":"顯","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wéi","traditional":"惟","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dé","traditional":"德","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"bǎi","traditional":"百","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"pì","traditional":"辟","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xíng","traditional":"刑","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。”"},{"pinyin":"shì","traditional":"是","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"gù","traditional":"故","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jūn","traditional":"君","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"笃","pinyin":"dǔ","traditional":"篤","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"gōng","traditional":"恭","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"tiān","traditional":"天","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xià","traditional":"下","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"píng","traditional":"平","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Di dalam Kitab Sanjak tertulis, \"Bukankah Kebajikan yang maha cemerlang itu telah menjadikan beratus negara bagian menurut perintah?\" (IV. 1.1.4). Maka seorang Junzi - Kuncu dengan ketulusan dan hormatnya membawa damai di dunia."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.33.06","number":6,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"modern":"诗","pinyin":"shī","traditional":"詩","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yún","traditional":"云","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"：“"},{"pinyin":"yǔ","traditional":"予","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"怀","pinyin":"huái","traditional":"懷","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"míng","traditional":"明","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dé","traditional":"德","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dà","traditional":"大","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"声","pinyin":"shēng","traditional":"聲","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"以","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"sè","traditional":"色","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。”"},{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yuē","traditional":"曰","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"：“"},{"modern":"声","pinyin":"shēng","traditional":"聲","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"sè","traditional":"色","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"于","pinyin":"yú","traditional":"於","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"以","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"huà","traditional":"化","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"mín","traditional":"民","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"mò","traditional":"末","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yě","traditional":"也","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。”"}],[{"modern":"诗","pinyin":"shī","traditional":"詩","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yuē","traditional":"曰","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"：“"},{"pinyin":"dé","traditional":"德","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"𬨎","pinyin":"yóu","traditional":"輶","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rú","traditional":"如","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"máo","traditional":"毛","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。”"},{"pinyin":"máo","traditional":"毛","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"犹","pinyin":"yóu","traditional":"猶","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǒu","traditional":"有","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"伦","pinyin":"lún","traditional":"倫","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。“"},{"pinyin":"shàng","traditional":"上","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"tiān","traditional":"天","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"载","pinyin":"zài","traditional":"載","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"无","pinyin":"wú","traditional":"無","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"声","pinyin":"shēng","traditional":"聲","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"无","pinyin":"wú","traditional":"無","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"chòu","traditional":"臭","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。”"},{"pinyin":"zhì","traditional":"至","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"矣","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Di dalam Kitab Sanjak tertulis, (Tuhan berfirman), \"Aku berkahi Kebajikan Yang Bercahaya yang tidak besar suara dan rupa.\" (III. 3.6.6) Nabi bersabda, \"Suara dan rupa itu hanya bagian yang paling akhir untuk memperbaiki rakyat.\" Di dalam Kitab Sanjak tertulis, \"Kebajikan itu ringan bagai bulu, namun bulu masih ada bandingnya.\" (III. 1.1.7) Tuhan Yang Maha Esa, Yang Maha Tinggi dan Pendukung semuanya itu tiada suara dan tiada bau. Demikianlah KesempurnaanNya."}],"source_file":"02 - Zhong Yong 中庸/33 - Bab XXXII - Maha Sempurna Tian.md","title":"Bab XXXII — Maha Sempurna Tian"}
